{"tmdb":920167,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Near the end of the Showa era in the late 1980s, in Misaki town, an old mansion is rumored to be the home of a witch. After moving into the mansion, Aoko Aozaki begins to learn sorcery from a young mage, Alice Kuonji, the rumored witch of the mansion. The Aozaki family oversees the land on which Misaki is built and the heir (Aoko) is tasked with protecting it. Mysterious intruders have been disrupting the bounded field in Misaki, leading Alice and Aoko to investigate. A mannequin or puppet attacks them and is incinerated. As this happens, both of them spot someone running away, a civilian who must not get away having seen magic alive. Unexpectedly, a young boy named Soujuurou Shizuki is drawn to the mansion and comes to reside with them as well.","directors":[{"name":"Hikaru Kondou","id":931823},{"name":"Masaru Takeuchi","id":1620254}],"cast":[{"actor":"Haruka Tomatsu","role":"Aoko Aozaki (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","tmdb":1248340},{"actor":"Kana Hanazawa","role":"Alice Kuonji (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg","tmdb":119143},{"actor":"Yusuke Kobayashi","role":"Sojuro Shizuki (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/y4ukKDSobZJNuB4H3k89hkrKCDC.jpg","tmdb":1350418},{"actor":"Shohei Kajikawa","role":"Housuke Kinomi (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yZccGkTo1lgdnDzBAH94B3i6ig5.jpg","tmdb":1255697},{"actor":"Chika Anzai","role":"Kojika Kumari (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lk3Az9O67qrXR69rctwDDHWqi9d.jpg","tmdb":1324927},{"actor":"Toshinari Fukamachi","role":"Tobimaru Tsukiji (voice)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/o7BCrhWApisvlVSsb9JAVVCNW5M.jpg","tmdb":2018183}],"trailers":[{"key":"bkvGGVHT08M","name":"Theme Song Trailer [Subtitled]","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-10-27"},{"key":"UGnGTBBszJI","name":"Official Trailer 2 [Subtitled]","type":"Trailer","published":"2026-10-2